# BLOOD configuration overview. Each app has its own .env.example with details:
#   apps/launcher/.env.example  — build-time values baked into the desktop app (not secret)
#   apps/api/.env.example       — server secrets (Stripe, database). Never ship these in the launcher.
#
# Release signing secrets (GitHub repository secrets, see docs/RELEASE.md):
#   TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY=REPLACE_WITH_UPDATER_PRIVATE_KEY
#   TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY_PASSWORD=REPLACE_ME
#   WINDOWS_CERTIFICATE=BASE64_OF_YOUR_CODE_SIGNING_PFX
#   WINDOWS_CERTIFICATE_PASSWORD=REPLACE_ME
#   VITE_MS_CLIENT_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
#   VITE_BLOOM_API_URL=https://bloomlauncher.example
